{"server":"tw","storyId":"act13side_level_act13side_09_end","groupId":"act13side","stageId":"act13side_09","title":"歎息","storyCode":"NL-9","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act13side/level_act13side_09_end.txt","sourceHash":"9eafc3dec0b2672bfd4b7324fd352d9565a8eb3e6d01eab88410bf4b7d76eca0","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"卡西米尔2-9-2"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G10"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"新聞裡的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"血騎士成功闖入決賽，成為卡西米爾特錦賽歷史上第二位有望連任冠軍的大騎士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"新聞裡的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不過，血騎士的感染者身份依舊帶來了許多非議。聯合會發言人表示，“不會因為血騎士的感染者身份而區別對待”——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"新聞裡的聲音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但部分騎士家族並不認可這一說法，斷電事件與大隔斷再演給民眾帶來的壓力不可估量，下面有請騎士協會負責人發言——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......狄開俄波利斯！血騎士！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈！我就說，這才是感染者騎士該有的樣子！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾納蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"......如果耀騎士贏了風騎士，那麼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查絲汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......兩個感染者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查絲汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"本屆特錦賽冠軍，會在，兩個感染者之中決出......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈！這不是一件好事嗎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們讓那群傢伙知道，他們引以為豪的城市並不是無懈可擊的，然後，血騎士和耀騎士會揭開他們的遮羞布——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"感染者大獲全勝！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾納蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"......真有這麼簡單就好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾納蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"於是，我們呢，接下來怎麼辦？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"......啊哈哈......反正大騎士領是待不下去了嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"但是我們可以得到一些合法證明，然後找個村子，找個地方，安安穩穩地過日子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾納蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"......這和我們一開始想的不一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還沒到解甲歸田的時候呢，索娜！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們不是為了讓更多感染礦石病的人能被合理對待嗎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把商業聯合會在零號地塊的所作所為告知監正會，不是為了救下更多的感染者嗎！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還沒到離開的時候！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查絲汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾納蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"......我很難反駁，索娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾納蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"我們現在離開，就像是半途而廢一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"索娜？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"......為什麼大部分感染者會被拋棄？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"不，這個問題不大對，我想想啊......為什麼，感染者總是些......不被重視的人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾納蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"暴露在高危環境中的工人，沒法有效躲避天災的農民，城市之外無家可歸的流浪者，這些人，是最容易染上礦石病的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查絲汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......被精加工後的寶石製品。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查絲汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也許是富有的騎士貴族和社會上層，這輩子唯一見過的源石吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查絲汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們當然和礦石病無緣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾納蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"......為什麼問這個？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"......沒什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"瑟奇亞克和我們一起走嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟奇亞克","speakerId":"avg_npc_103nc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你在說什麼蠢話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，原來你在啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"查絲汀娜","speakerId":"avg_430_fartth_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的妻子和孩子還好嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟奇亞克","speakerId":"avg_npc_103nc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，所以我是來道謝的，只要能救出他們，怎麼樣都好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟奇亞克","speakerId":"avg_npc_103nc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，我可不是感染者。明面上，我甚至還保留有合法的騎士身份。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟奇亞克","speakerId":"avg_npc_103nc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不打算待在大騎士領，我會用前些年積累下來的財富購置一處地產，換一座城市生活吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"不考慮在移動城市之外的地方定居嗎？那樣比較容易避人耳目吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟奇亞克","speakerId":"avg_npc_103nc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那就不是“生活”了，是“生存”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟奇亞克","speakerId":"avg_npc_103nc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是來道別的，特錦賽還沒結束，人流量很大，這是悄悄離開大騎士領的好機會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"......新的城市嗎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟奇亞克","speakerId":"avg_npc_103nc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......紅松騎士團，我得對你們說句實話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟奇亞克","speakerId":"avg_npc_103nc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"監正會取得了關於無胄盟和感染者收容治療中心的資訊，也不代表，他們能立刻把聯合會趕下台——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟奇亞克","speakerId":"avg_npc_103nc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——不，我現在甚至開始覺得，他們根本威脅不到商業聯合會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟奇亞克","speakerId":"avg_npc_103nc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也察覺到一點什麼了，對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟奇亞克","speakerId":"avg_npc_103nc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可別說我絕情，但這都和現在的我沒關係了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑟奇亞克","speakerId":"avg_npc_103nc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"念在我們共同戰鬥過一小段時日的份上......好自為之吧，別和城市作對，焰尾。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾沃娜","speakerId":"avg_496_wdmane_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......什麼啊，只是過來說洩氣話的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾納蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我才討厭騎士家族。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"......和城市，作對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"聽著有些像滑稽的騎士小說啊......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G09"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礫","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礫","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我被命令成為您的護衛，也有一段時間了，您對我......是怎麼想的呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礫","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不瞞您說，我現在，只是和您共處一室就有些心跳加速了喔？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"要叫醫生嗎？","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礫","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀......真是讓人遺憾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礫","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我覺得，您是在裝作聽不懂？"}]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礫","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"偶爾的沉默也很令人著迷，不過，如果博士您太過沉溺在工作中，也是會累壞身子的。"}]},{"label":"私人問題請恕我暫時回避。","value":"3","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礫","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這可事關監正會和羅德島的合作......您對我的評價可是很重要的。"}]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"博士！臨光小姐順利進入決賽了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"“風騎士賽前棄權，耀騎士不戰而勝”，今天的報紙上是這麼寫的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礫","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......風騎士離隱退只有一步之遙，大概不願意在這個時候敗給耀騎士吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礫","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真是有些嫉妒耀騎士了，能讓博士這麼關心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"礫、礫小姐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礫","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，沒別的意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"礫","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......暫時。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......哈哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"（博、博士，礫小姐是不是最近心情不太好？總覺得她越來越......啊？博士覺得這才是她本來的面目？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米婭","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"（好、好吧，如果博士都這麼說的話......）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G03"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"......呃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"......慢著......等等......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"我有多少人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"三隊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"您......和莫妮克閣下？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們有別的任務啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"......那......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"玄鐵大位就更別想了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......他們也有別的任務。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"......無胄盟是不是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"察覺到了的話，乖乖當作不知道，比較容易活下去哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"......好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"所以說，我要帶三隊無胄盟，去負責特錦賽決賽的守衛和預警工作，是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"......耀騎士和血騎士的決戰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"......可能會和銀槍天馬正面碰上？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"......原來如此......這次的任務是要我自殺嗎......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"話別這麼說啊，只要別動起手來不就好了嗎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"......我還能被利用多久？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——真高興你能有這個自覺。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"特錦賽結束之後，我會怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看你的表現......從我個人來講，至少......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還是想留你一命的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"白金","speakerId":"char_204_platnm","isRemote":false,"text":"......！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_nearllivingroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪恩納","speakerId":"avg_npc_108","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......叔叔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪恩納","speakerId":"avg_npc_108","isRemote":false,"text":"......你已經把事情做到了這一步，不聽勸阻，一意孤行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪恩納","speakerId":"avg_npc_108","isRemote":false,"text":"你想過那些因你的幼稚舉動而受到傷害的人嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪恩納","speakerId":"avg_npc_108","isRemote":false,"text":"你想過馬丁他們會因此被無胄盟盯上嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪恩納","speakerId":"avg_npc_108","isRemote":false,"text":"你想過瑪莉婭和佐菲婭也許不再能安穩地生活在大騎士領嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪恩納","speakerId":"avg_npc_108","isRemote":false,"text":"你空有一腔理想，瑪嘉烈，但記住，你最大的錯誤，就是替別人決定了他們生活的軌跡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪恩納","speakerId":"avg_npc_108","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有任何人，有這個權力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪恩納","speakerId":"avg_npc_108","isRemote":false,"text":"我對你失望至極。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"瑪莉婭，你如實告訴我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是我剝奪了你的夢想嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你把參賽資格以家族名義讓渡給我......你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐！我從來沒這麼想過！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是......確實不覺得騎士這條道路適合自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......接著說吧，妹妹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我真的很久沒有聽你......吐露心聲了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"......姐姐的行為......我不理解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"我是在懷疑......成為騎士，在當今的卡西米爾，到底還有什麼意義？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"我們獲勝的時候，觀眾們在為什麼歡呼？我們又贏得了什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"就算......姐姐是想在他們的規則之中，戰勝那些不希望姐姐獲勝的傢伙們......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"可如果他們順水推舟地讓姐姐獲勝了呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"又或者，他們一開始就對這個所謂的規則，根本不屑一顧呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你說得對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們一開始就對騎士不屑一顧，我當然知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"......什麼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"成為冠軍沒有任何意義。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"意義在於......那些矚目著我們的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"瑪莉婭，如果你覺得這座城市，這個國家出了問題，你認為病灶在哪裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是監正會的腐敗墮落，是商業聯合會毫無底線的擴張與剝削？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也許是任何一種，也許二者都是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們常說卡西米爾需要重拾榮光，就必須有人告訴他們，何為榮耀與正義。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪莉婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"該去拾起那些榮光的，不只是騎士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"勝利不是為了擊敗敵人，瑪莉婭，“騎士即是照亮整片大地的崇高者”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但在照亮前行的道路，驅散荊棘，填平溝壑之後......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"應當教每一個不願被擺佈的人，去跨越苦難。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_towerinside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"腐敗騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_102_2","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"托蘭","speakerId":"avg_npc_213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......總算醒了，都這麼長時間了，我還以為你們死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"腐敗騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_102_2","isRemote":false,"text":"你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"腐敗騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_102_2","isRemote":false,"text":"你......你是薩卡茲......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"托蘭","speakerId":"avg_npc_213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還能正常交流，看來你比你的兄弟好些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"腐敗騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_102_2","isRemote":false,"text":"......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凋零騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_102","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"托蘭","speakerId":"avg_npc_213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放心，也沒死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"托蘭","speakerId":"avg_npc_213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"用在護甲修復技術上的特殊液體，直接讓人服用會有這樣的效果嗎......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"托蘭","speakerId":"avg_npc_213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原理是活性化？卡西米爾的騎士盔甲是用什麼造的？人和盔甲都能活性化？那源石蟲呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"腐敗騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_102_2","isRemote":false,"text":"......你......去角的薩卡茲......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"腐敗騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_102_2","isRemote":false,"text":"你是......無胄盟？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"托蘭","speakerId":"avg_npc_213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，抬舉我了，無胄盟的年收入可能是我的三千倍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"托蘭","speakerId":"avg_npc_213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是個賞金獵人。來大騎士領辦點事情，其中包括關於......薩卡茲的一點小調查。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"托蘭","speakerId":"avg_npc_213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，不是公務，只是我個人好奇的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"托蘭","speakerId":"avg_npc_213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——斬斷雙角的薩卡茲，除了我，你們還見過別人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"腐敗騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_102_2","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"托蘭","speakerId":"avg_npc_213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"誰鋸斷你們的角？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"托蘭","speakerId":"avg_npc_213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"誰把——薩卡茲——當做實驗的奴隸和劊子手？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"腐敗騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_102_2","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"托蘭","speakerId":"avg_npc_213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧。被馴服得真徹底。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"托蘭","speakerId":"avg_npc_213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"跟我走嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"腐敗騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_102_2","isRemote":false,"text":"......什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"托蘭","speakerId":"avg_npc_213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們這麼大塊頭，能幹很多活吧？我們可是在荒地上紮營的，最缺的就是勞動力——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"腐敗騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_102_2","isRemote":false,"text":"你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"托蘭","speakerId":"avg_npc_213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——跟我走，薩卡茲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"托蘭","speakerId":"avg_npc_213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"跟我走才能活下去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_sportsbar"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_120","isRemote":false,"text":"......唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"巴特巴雅爾......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_120","isRemote":false,"text":"你這個毛頭小子，把你送去醫院都沒有家屬給你付錢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_120","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，你這身子也確實結實，換別人挨上血騎士那一下，恐怕不死也得少半條命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_120","isRemote":false,"text":"就算是獨立騎士，一路打比賽到四強，應該也存了不少錢吧？你的錢都去哪了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_120","isRemote":false,"text":"別亂動，傷口很深。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_120","isRemote":false,"text":"......你要去哪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_120","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，慢著，你要去哪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"......離開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"金色的天馬，血色的米諾斯人，我......收獲頗豐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_120","isRemote":false,"text":"......你不甘心嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"......不，我失敗了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"然後，我不再恐懼失敗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"不再畏懼退縮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"不再畏懼......讚美弱小。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"......但我仍有欠缺......我還是得，走完天途。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_120","isRemote":false,"text":"天途天途的......你的目的地到底是哪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_120","isRemote":false,"text":"就算在古代，也沒有一條天途走幾年的習俗吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"北方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"在遙遠的北方......與先祖消失之地呼應的北方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_120","isRemote":false,"text":"......你走到那裡去，然後呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_120","isRemote":false,"text":"你還打算回來嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魘騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_120","isRemote":false,"text":"你......我以為你只是尋找一些自己缺失的東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_120","isRemote":false,"text":"結果......你卻在尋死嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["阿米婭"]},{"speakerId":"char_204_platnm","aliases":["白金"]}]}
